  message: "Owner decision 2026-11-11: COMPLETE FOR THE FORESEEABLE FUTURE. Closed as wont_do (not done: nothing here was built). Local narrowing stays opt-in; making it block-level and default-on is dropped. Measured reasons are on WI-zajuv: narrowing applies to about 18 percent of source commits, and 69 whole-tree text readers set a floor of about 3 minutes. Reopen only if the owner asks. The earlier technical trigger (someone builds a reliable map of which whole-tree text-reading tests depend on which source file) has no watcher, so it will not fire by itself."  # 8364
